  "title": "Transparent Multicore Scaling of Single-Threaded Network Functions",
  "abstract": "This paper presents NFOS, a programming model, runtime, and profiler for productively developing software network functions (NFs) that scale on multicore machines. Writing shared-state concurrent systems that are both correct and scalable is still a serious challenge, which is why NFOS insulates developers from writing concurrent code.",
